{%- comment -%}
  The Mionas form submit button. There is no design-system Button component to mirror for a
  <button>: ../design-system's Button renders an anchor, and so does blocks/mionas-button.liquid
  (see its line 45). So this reproduces the primary/md/full-width Button look by spending the same
  --button-* tokens directly.

  It exists as a snippet rather than being inlined because it had two callers the moment
  blocks/_mionas-form-submit.liquid was added, and the copy in blocks/mionas-contact-form.liquid
  carried a "Keep the two in agreement" comment that had already started to be a liability. One
  implementation, two callers.

  NOT a caller: blocks/corporate-quote-form.liquid. That form uses Horizon's native `.button` class
  with only `align-self: flex-start`. Repointing it here would restyle a live B2B page, so it was
  deliberately left alone -- see the spec's "corporate-quote-form is not a copy" section.

  Accepts:
    label   Required. Button text.
    note    Optional. Secondary line below the button, centered. Blank renders nothing.
    class   Extra classes on the button.

  Renders the button and the note as SIBLINGS with no wrapper, so the caller's own flex column
  (snippets/mionas-form.liquid, or the block's card) provides the gap between them.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign submit_classes = 'mionas-submit-button'
  if class
    assign submit_classes = submit_classes | append: ' ' | append: class
  endif
%}
<button type="submit" class="{{ submit_classes }}">{{- label -}}</button>
{%- if note != blank -%}
  <p class="mionas-submit-button__note">{{ note }}</p>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Reproduces mionas-button's primary/md/full-width look. Moved verbatim from
     blocks/mionas-contact-form.liquid, which now renders this snippet instead. */
  .mionas-submit-button {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: var(--button-size-md-height);
    padding: 0 var(--button-size-md-padding);
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--button-base-radius);
    background: var(--button-primary-background);
    color: var(--button-primary-foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-family-archivo);
    font-size: var(--button-size-md-font-size);
    font-weight: var(--button-base-font-weight);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mionas-submit-button:active {
    transform: scale(var(--button-state-pressed-scale));
    opacity: var(--button-state-pressed-opacity);
  }

  /* Secondary body text, so this spends Card's description token rather than a form-label one. */
  .mionas-submit-button__note {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--card-description-foreground);
    font-size: var(--font-size-13);
    text-align: center;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
